=== GALACTIC PILOT GUIDE: COMBAT & DEFENSE ===

Hostile Void Marauders patrol deep space and contest trade routes.
* FIGHTERS: Autonomous combat drones that assault enemy vessels.
* DEFLECTOR SHIELDS: Energy barriers absorbing direct laser fire.

TACTICAL OPTIONS:
  [Attack]: Launch fighters in aggressive offensive strike.
  [Shields Up]: Overcharge shields to deflect 75% incoming damage!
                Shields absorb laser fire and protect fighters & hull.
  [Flee]: Engage emergency jump drives to escape into hyperspace.
